2026-11-26 05:25 Done: no Perl location in status.message; 404 on the providerRef says 'it does not exist in namespace NS' (reconcile and teardown); other errors via OCP::ErrorLine::api_error_line // one_line. Tests: t/33 (404, 500, croaking provider build), t/179 (teardown 404), t/45 regex updated to the new 404 wording (claim kept: absence distinguished from an API error). Red before fix, green after: 12 robocop test files, 95 tests PASS in raudssus/ocp:latest. Uncommitted.
